{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蘇黎世保險(香港)懷疑發生資料外洩，涉近4萬人姓名、身份證及護照號碼等個人資料。</p><p></p><p>受影響的包括蘇黎世人壽保險(香港)，它們向客戶通報指，指周二偵測到懷疑被黑客入侵。初步調查顯示，有客戶個人資料，包括姓名、身份證號碼、保單資料等，或被未經授權存取。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PRIVACY-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LxldrngtGy1795089510.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>暫無證據顯示，涉及銀行戶口、信用卡等，已暫時停用相關網上平台，並通知受影響客戶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.426661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:17.151727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:37.188827+00:00","content_hash":"89244088e32447e29a417477d3833b4cf7f154175ff9c3daf7fa9a7843fdfcc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.426661+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}